\f1\fs22 \'93King of the Whole Wide World\'94 was one of the few Elvis songs whose lyrics seemed to have leaked into this fractured universe without the distortion of the mischievous Lady Mondegreen. But that didn\'92t stop Johnny from filtering what he heard of them, so much so that he made it his ring tone. Johnny cared nothing that he couldn\'92t sing, but he wanted all the other things\'97the oysters, the pearls, the princesses (he\'92d settle for one in particular).\
